# The logistic map
# The simplest model of a population with a limit: next year's population
# from this year's. As r grows the steady population gives way to cycles of
# 2, 4, 8, ... years, and then to chaos (May, 1976).
x(t+1)=r*x*(1-x)
par r=3.9
init x=0.2
@ meth=discrete,total=200
@ xp=t,yp=x,xlo=0,xhi=200,ylo=0,yhi=1
done
